11. Termination and reinstatement

The permissions granted by this License terminate automatically and immediately
upon breach.

For the Individual's first breach of this License, the permissions are
automatically reinstated if the Individual fully ceases and cures the breach
within 30 days after first becoming aware of it, including through notice from
the Licensor. This automatic reinstatement is available only once. A later
breach terminates the permissions permanently unless the Licensor expressly
reinstates them in writing.

Upon an effective termination, the Individual must stop using the Software and
delete copies under the Individual's control, except for records retained by
GitHub under its terms, material that applicable law requires to be retained,
and Accepted Contributions already licensed under Section 6.2. Any retained
material may not be used except as applicable law permits.

